          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Ratko Mladic died in The Hague at age 84 while serving a life sentence for genocide, war crimes, and crimes against humanity.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/thousands-bid-farewell-bosnian-serb-war-criminal-in-belgrade-6368116",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
