          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "The United Nations war crimes court convicted Ratko Mladic of genocide over the 1995 Srebrenica massacre, where around 8,000 Bosnian Muslim men and boys were killed.",
          "kind": "background",
